#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to find answers to questions or problems you encounter while using IBM Quantum"
msgstr "Comment trouver des réponses à tes questions ou résoudre les problèmes rencontrés lors de l'utilisation d'IBM Quantum"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Support"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support {#support}"
msgstr "Support {#support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get help with IBM Quantum Platform and Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-quantum-platform-and-qiskit}"
msgstr "Obtenir de l'aide avec IBM Quantum Platform et Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-quantum-platform-and-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, special programs, and Open Plan (excludes Trial accounts):**\n"
msgstr "**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, programmes spéciaux et Open Plan (hors comptes Trial) :**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All support inquiries must be submitted through the [IBM Cloud&reg; Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Depending on your account type, you can either open a Cloud Case (Topic: Quantum Compute) or a Technical Issue (Topic: Report-an-Issue::Quantum Compute). Ensure you have selected the appropriate IBM Cloud account (your institutional cloud account or any non-trial account) in the account switcher.\n"
msgstr "Toutes les demandes de support doivent être soumises via le [IBM Cloud&reg; Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Selon le type de ton compte, tu peux soit ouvrir un Cloud Case (Topic : Quantum Compute) soit un Technical Issue (Topic : Report-an-Issue::Quantum Compute). Assure-toi d'avoir sélectionné le compte IBM Cloud approprié (ton compte cloud institutionnel ou tout compte non-trial) dans le sélecteur de compte.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see all your open IBM Cloud cases or to open a new case, visit the [IBM Cloud Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"
msgstr "Pour voir tous tes cas IBM Cloud ouverts ou pour ouvrir un nouveau cas, visite le [IBM Cloud Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please reach out for any technical matter, including platform issues, job errors, Qiskit guidance, or broader quantum computing questions. Our team includes technical experts ready to assist across this full range of topics.\n"
msgstr "N'hésite pas à nous contacter pour toute question technique, notamment les problèmes de plateforme, les erreurs de jobs, l'aide à Qiskit, ou les questions plus générales sur l'informatique quantique. Notre équipe comprend des experts techniques prêts à t'assister sur l'ensemble de ces sujets.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Community support:**\n"
msgstr "**Support communautaire :**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Have a Trial account or looking for other support options?  [Join the Qiskit Slack community](https://qisk.it/join-slack) to get help from our large community of users and experts. In Slack you will find topical channels such as #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-ecosystem, and many more.\n"
msgstr "Tu as un compte Trial ou tu cherches d'autres options de support ? [Rejoins la communauté Qiskit Slack](https://qisk.it/join-slack) pour obtenir de l'aide auprès de notre large communauté d'utilisateurs et d'experts. Dans Slack, tu trouveras des canaux thématiques tels que #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-ecosystem, et bien d'autres encore.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also use [Stack Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) for support from the wider community about quantum computing and programming-related questions.\n"
msgstr "Tu peux également utiliser [Stack Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) pour obtenir de l'aide de la communauté élargie sur les questions liées à l'informatique quantique et à la programmation.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Having trouble creating an account or logging in? {#having-trouble-creating-an-account-or-logging-in}"
msgstr "Tu as du mal à créer un compte ou à te connecter ? {#having-trouble-creating-an-account-or-logging-in}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**If you get an error when you create an IBM Cloud&reg; account,** first check whether you have access to the [Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) on IBM Cloud.\n"
msgstr "**Si tu obtiens une erreur lors de la création d'un compte IBM Cloud&reg;,** vérifie d'abord si tu as accès au [Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) sur IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have access to the \"Create Case\" page, choose Account (Managing your account and resources) as the category, followed by Account verification as the Subtopic.\n"
msgstr "Si tu as accès à la page « Create Case », choisis Account (Managing your account and resources) comme catégorie, puis Account verification comme Subtopic.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you do not have access, open a case on the [Create an Account, Login or Billing Request](https://watson.service-now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create) page.\n"
msgstr "Si tu n'y as pas accès, ouvre un cas sur la page [Create an Account, Login or Billing Request](https://watson.service-now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are getting an error while trying to create an account and **your country is on the [Personal use availability](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-getting-started#signup-personalaccts) list,** explore the following options:\n"
msgstr "Si tu obtiens une erreur en tentant de créer un compte et que **ton pays figure sur la liste [Personal use availability](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-getting-started#signup-personalaccts),** explore les options suivantes :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [Documentation](/docs) and [Learning](/learning) resources without an account.\n"
msgstr "Tu peux utiliser les ressources de [Documentation](/docs) et de [Learning](/learning) sans compte.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are a student or educator at a degree-granting accredited academic institution, you can create a [SkillsBuild Technology Access account](https://github.com/academic-initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (see the [SkillsBuild Technology Access FAQ](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) for more information).\n"
msgstr "Si tu es étudiant·e ou enseignant·e dans un établissement d'enseignement supérieur accrédité, tu peux créer un [compte SkillsBuild Technology Access](https://github.com/academic-initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (voir la [FAQ SkillsBuild Technology Access](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) pour plus d'informations).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Trial account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) for 30 days of free access (Note that you will likely lose access at the end of the trial).\n"
msgstr "[Crée un compte Trial](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) pour 30 jours d'accès gratuit (note qu'il est probable que tu perdes l'accès à la fin de la période d'essai).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**If you see the message \"This account is inactive\",** visit the [IBM Cloud Docs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ts_accnt_inactive) to learn why and how to fix it, or access [IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) to verify if you have any pending actions to complete in your account.\n"
msgstr "**Si tu vois le message « This account is inactive »,** consulte la [documentation IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ts_accnt_inactive) pour en savoir plus sur les causes possibles et comment y remédier, ou accède à [IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) pour vérifier si des actions en attente sont à effectuer dans ton compte.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Note\">\n"
"If you are the **owner** of a Pay-As-You-Go or Subscription account, you need to create an IBM Cloud account and provide billing information for verification.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Remarque\">\n"
"Si tu es le **propriétaire** d'un compte Pay-As-You-Go ou Subscription, tu dois créer un compte IBM Cloud et fournir des informations de facturation pour la vérification.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are **invited to join** an account, simply accept the email invitation and follow the [provided steps](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) to gain access without providing billing information.\n"
msgstr "Si tu es **invité·e à rejoindre** un compte, accepte simplement l'invitation par e-mail et suis les [étapes indiquées](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) pour obtenir l'accès sans fournir d'informations de facturation.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trial account owners** can create an Open Plan instance for 30 days without providing billing information. At the end of the trial, users must provide billing information to verify and continue using their account. User will *not be charged* if they continue using the free Open Plan, but can choose to upgrade to other paid plans at that time.\n"
msgstr "Les **propriétaires de comptes Trial** peuvent créer une instance Open Plan pendant 30 jours sans fournir d'informations de facturation. À la fin de la période d'essai, les utilisateurs doivent fournir des informations de facturation pour vérifier leur compte et continuer à l'utiliser. L'utilisateur *ne sera pas facturé* s'il continue à utiliser l'Open Plan gratuit, mais peut choisir de passer à d'autres plans payants à ce moment-là.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information about IBM Cloud accounts, visit the [IBM Cloud account FAQs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour plus d'informations sur les comptes IBM Cloud, consulte la page [IBM Cloud account FAQs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open-source support {#open-source-support}"
msgstr "Support open source {#open-source-support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [Open-source resources](/guides/) for details on contributing code to Qiskit. Information there includes the [code of conduct](/guides/code-of-conduct), PDF license agreements for [individual](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) and [corporate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-cla.pdf) contributors, [version strategy](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-strategy), and the [contributor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) and [maintainer](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md) guides.\n"
msgstr "Consulte les [ressources open source](/guides/) pour en savoir plus sur la contribution de code à Qiskit. Tu y trouveras notamment le [code de conduite](/guides/code-of-conduct), les accords de licence PDF pour les contributeurs [individuels](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) et [entreprises](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-cla.pdf), la [stratégie de versionnement](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-strategy), ainsi que les guides du [contributeur](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) et du [mainteneur](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To report bugs, make feature requests, and see what's coming in future releases, visit the individual GitHub repositories:\n"
msgstr "Pour signaler des bugs, faire des demandes de fonctionnalités et voir ce qui arrive dans les prochaines versions, visite les dépôts GitHub individuels :\n"

